1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,800
Opening Tepera

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,800
Turning on "Idea over the feed"

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,800
Prominent disclosure shown before
the permission request

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,800
User declines ("Not now"): the feature stays off,
the app keeps working

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Disclosure shown again when the user retries

6
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:43,800
User agrees ("I agree") and turns on the service
in Android's own Accessibility settings

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Back in Tepera: the feature is now active

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:09,500
A chosen app opens during a scrolling hour:
a suggestion appears instead of the feed

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
5 minutes later

10
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:31,500
After 5 minutes: a gentle dim with
"5 more" / "Leave" buttons

11
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,500
Touches still work through the dim:
the user decides

12
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,500
The user taps "Leave" and returns
to the home screen

13
00:01:46,000 --> 00:02:01,000
The service can be turned off at any time
in Android settings

14
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:08,000
The service is turned off

15
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:10,800
End of demo
